    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"releasing\" part... it sounds almost peaceful. but it feels more like just... disappearing. like, if there's no point to any of the effort, then isn't the most logical thing to just let go of the struggle entirely? to just stop existing in this cycle?",
